  "description": "Blockchain analytics and AI agent platform for Ethereum. Query live token prices, on-chain stories, investment theses, and the E3D autonomous agent system — all backed by real-time indexed data.\n\n**Works anonymously** at the free tier (100 req/day). Add an API key from [e3d.ai/api](https://e3d.ai/api) for higher rate limits.\n\n**Tools include:**\n- Token prices, gainers/losers across 30m / 1h / 24h / 7d / 30d\n- On-chain stories and structured investment theses\n- Token and wallet identity, counterparty flow analysis\n- AI agent status, executions, burn history, next actions",
